<title>SINGAPORE: Seaview Hotel 1996 net down 3 percent.</title>
<headline>Seaview Hotel 1996 net down 3 percent.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year ended June 30 1996</p>
<p>( in million of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		     3.84  vs  3.96</p>
<p>    Group shares (cents)	17.39  vs 17.93</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)	    10.00  vs 10.00</p>
<p>    Turnover			23.36  vs 21.50</p>
<p>    Pretax			   5.12  vs  6.66</p>
<p>    Tax				1.28  vs  2.70</p>
<p>Div pay/ register - December 18, December 5 1996</p>
<p>- Note - Seaview Hotel Ltd said group results were affected by the weak retail and electronics sector which resulted in an operating loss of Singapore $1.2 million in a subsidiary.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
